# Docker matches these from the build-context root: every pattern needs **/ to reach subfolders.
# Secrets must never enter the image (dotenv would also load a stray backend/.env).
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/*.log
frontend/e2e
backend/reports
backups
.git
